00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:34.019
They heard other sounds after that initial
period yesterday of about four or five hours

00:02:34.019 --> 00:02:36.470
or so, but it wasn't banging.

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:40.730
So they are not clear, it's not clear what
they were hearing down there at that point.

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:43.590
But just an excruciating weight.

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:51.020
An absolute concern here for what, if they
are alive, what they must be going through

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:56.470
down there in the cold and the dark and just
hoping against hope that they are rescued.

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:57.470
[8:04:12 AM]
that they are rescued.

